search the merged catalog

Usage: ambit search [OPTIONS] <pattern>

Arguments:
  <pattern>  glob matched against item names; `*` matches every name

Options:
      --catalog <name>     limit to this catalog; repeatable
      --capability <kind>  limit to this namespace; repeatable [possible values: pack, skill, mcp,
                           hook]
      --project <dir>      project directory
      --json               machine-readable output
      --offline            use only cached catalogs
  -h, --help               Print help
